# 跨平台统一行尾为 LF，避免 autocrlf 引入的换行符噪声
# Rust / JS / JSON / Markdown 项目均以 LF 为规范
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本保持 CRLF：cmd.exe 对 LF-only 批处理解析有问题（标签/goto 错位）
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做行尾转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.msi binary
*.exe binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
